    "show_share": true,
    "description": "The Aga Khan University Institute for Educational Development (AKU-IED), in collaboration with the US Mission in Pakistan, successfully hosted the final Policy Dialogue for the Climate Action Fellowship 2024 at IMCG F11/3 College, Islamabad. The event marked the culmination of a yearlong fellowship that empowered 50 educators from Khyber Pakhtunkhwa (KP) as climate champions, catalysing grassroots efforts into tangible policy recommendations.",
